===Etymology===
{{rfe|de|The spelling Waage is much older than 1927 - at best it was re-introduced in 1927 (but how, through which rulebook?)}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|wāge}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|wāga}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*wēgǭ}}, {{m|gem-pro|*wēgō||weight; balance, scale}}. The second ''a'' was introduced in 1927 to distinguish it from {{m|de|Wagen}}. More at {{m|en|wey}}.

